  src '                   CHANGING lt_out lv_ok lv_msg.'.
  src '  IF lv_ok IS INITIAL.'.
  src '    WRITE: / ''  UID'', lv_uidc, ''could not be fetched.''.'.
  src '    PERFORM write_error USING lv_msg.'.
